<title>USA: Novatek sees $4 mln gross for six months.</title>
<headline>Novatek sees $4 mln gross for six months.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBIA, Md 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Novatek International Inc said Tuesday it expects a gross profit of $4 million for the six months ending December 31.</p>
</text>
